{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/oxford-cove-iman-developers-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1467,"crm_id":"7279","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Oxford Cove","slug":"oxford-cove-iman-developers-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["studio","apartment","duplex"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Iman Developers","price":679000,"display_price":"679K","lattitude":25.061739689131,"longitude":55.209658859801,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Oxford Cove by Iman Developers is a boutique off-plan residential development in Jumeirah Village Circle, designed around wellness, privacy, and contemporary architecture. Featuring <strong>studios, 1-bedroom, 1-bedroom with study, 2-bedroom, and duplex residences</strong> with private pools, the project combines flowing curved façades with resort-inspired amenities.</p><p>Residents enjoy a 38-meter leisure pool, rooftop infinity pool, clubhouse, fitness spaces, and landscaped family areas. Positioned in one of Dubai’s strongest rental-demand communities, Oxford Cove offers modern living with seamless access to Dubai Marina, Downtown Dubai, Palm Jumeirah, and major highways, making it attractive for both investors and end-users.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_fb8ac6c983.jpg","hash":"Feature_fb8ac6c983","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_fe1d75e66a.jpg","hash":"Banner_fe1d75e66a","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_9_a1449d8273.jpg","hash":"Gallery_9_a1449d8273","name":"Gallery-9.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazona